@startuml
title KanbanFlow Schema Responsibilities and Verification
package "Migration source" {
 rectangle "Core resources and membership" as Core
 rectangle "Activity and polymorphic notifications" as Secondary
 rectangle "Account / Session / Token infrastructure" as Account
 rectangle "Cache / Jobs infrastructure" as Infra
}
rectangle "Physical keys / Nullability / Defaults / Indexes" as Schema
rectangle "Models: Relationships / Casts / Soft deletion" as Models
rectangle "Controllers: Authority / Validation / WIP / Ordering" as Rules
database "Actual applied database schema and records" as DB
Core --> Schema
Secondary --> Schema
Account --> Schema
Infra --> Schema
Schema --> DB : migrations
Models --> DB
Rules --> Models
note bottom of Schema : FK cascade applies to physical deletion, not deleted_at updates.
note bottom of DB : Verify applied schema and engine; source alone is insufficient.
@enduml
